<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker 380-cst traded at $94.50/T.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker 380-cst traded at $94.50/T.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore bunker quotes on Friday were little changed but indications were far apart with some sellers unwilling to lower offers while others cut prices to corner buyers, brokers said.</p>
<p>Bunker 180-cst was quoted at $102-$105 and 380-cst at $94.50/$98, around Thursday's quotes.</p>
<p>&quot;I just closed a deal for 380 cst at $94.50,&quot; said one shipowner. &quot;There are plenty of sellers,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>&quot;Prices may move lower later on with some aggressive selling interest but most are still watching the cargo market,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3571)</p>
